{"seq":3,"slug":"anomaly-detection","title":"时序异常检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/applications/anomaly-detection","wordCount":1516,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"时序异常检测\">时序异常检测</h1><p>时序异常检测是预测的「反面」——不是预测下一个值会是多少，而是判断当前观测值是否偏离了「正常应该是」的范围。一个稳健的异常检测系统本质上是在做隐式预测：构建「如果一切正常，数据应该长什么样」的模型，然后把偏差足够大的点/段/模式标记为异常。从云基础设施的 SRE 告警到制造业的设备故障预警、从网络安全入侵检测到金融欺诈识别——时序异常检测无处不在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[时序异常类型] --&gt; B[点异常 Point Anomaly]&#10;    A --&gt; C[上下文异常 Contextual]&#10;    A --&gt; D[模式异常 Pattern / Collective]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[单个值超出预期范围]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[值本身正常但在当前上下文中异常]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[一段连续序列整体异常]&#10;    E[检测方法] --&gt; F[基于预测的方法]&#10;    E --&gt; G[基于重建的方法]&#10;    E --&gt; H[基于密度/距离的方法]&#10;    E --&gt; I[基于分类的方法]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[预测残差 &gt; 阈值]&#10;    G --&gt; G1[自编码器重建误差]&#10;    H --&gt; H1[Isolation Forest / LOF]&#10;    I --&gt; I1[One-Class SVM / DeepSVDD]\">flowchart TD\n    A[时序异常类型] --&gt; B[点异常 Point Anomaly]\n    A --&gt; C[上下文异常 Contextual]\n    A --&gt; D[模式异常 Pattern / Collective]\n    B --&gt; B1[单个值超出预期范围]\n    C --&gt; C1[值本身正常但在当前上下文中异常]\n    D --&gt; D1[一段连续序列整体异常]\n    E[检测方法] --&gt; F[基于预测的方法]\n    E --&gt; G[基于重建的方法]\n    E --&gt; H[基于密度/距离的方法]\n    E --&gt; I[基于分类的方法]\n    F --&gt; F1[预测残差 &gt; 阈值]\n    G --&gt; G1[自编码器重建误差]\n    H --&gt; H1[Isolation Forest / LOF]\n    I --&gt; I1[One-Class SVM / DeepSVDD]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>异常类型</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>检测难度</th>\n<th>典型方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>点异常（全局）</td>\n<td>服务器 CPU 突然飙升到 100%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>简单阈值 / Z-score</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点异常（上下文）</td>\n<td>凌晨 3 点的正常白天流量</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>季节调整后检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续偏移</td>\n<td>设备逐渐退化，指标缓慢漂移</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>变点检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模式异常</td>\n<td>网络请求模式突变但单值正常</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>子序列形状比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺失异常</td>\n<td>应该有数据的时段无数据</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>数据完整性监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"基于预测的异常检测\">基于预测的异常检测</h2><p>最直觉的方法：用预测模型预测「正常值应该是什么」，然后检测实际值与预测值的偏差。</p>\n<p><strong>异常分数计算</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>σ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_t = \\frac{|y_t - \\hat{y}_t|}{\\hat{\\sigma}_t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.263em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{y}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是预测均值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>σ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\sigma}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是预测标准差（来自概率预测）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_t &gt; \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>（阈值）时判定为异常。</p>\n<p><strong>动态阈值设定</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>固定阈值（如 3-sigma）：简单但对非平稳数据不适用</li>\n<li>自适应阈值：基于近期异常分数分布动态调整</li>\n<li>极值理论（EVT）：用 Peaks Over Threshold 方法从尾部分布推导阈值</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>概率预测的优势</strong>：TimesFM/Chronos 输出概率分布（分位数），可以直接用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>history</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(y_t | \\text{history})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">history</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 作为异常评分——观测值落在极低概率区域即为异常。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基于重建的方法\">基于重建的方法</h2><p><strong>自编码器（Autoencoder）</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>在正常数据上训练编码器-解码器</li>\n<li>正常数据的重建误差低</li>\n<li>异常数据（训练时未见过的模式）重建误差高</li>\n<li>重建误差 &gt; 阈值 → 异常</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>recon</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>Dec</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Enc</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{recon}} = \\|x - \\text{Dec}(\\text{Enc}(x))\\|^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recon</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Dec</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Enc</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>变分自编码器（VAE）</strong> 提供概率化的重建：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ELBO</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>KL</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ELBO} = E_{q(z|x)}[\\log p(x|z)] - \\text{KL}(q(z|x) \\| p(z))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ELBO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1052em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KL</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>VAE 的异常分数结合了重建概率和隐空间的先验偏离度。</p>\n<p><strong>Transformer 自编码器</strong>（2024-2026 主流）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用 masked patch 预训练（类似 PatchTST）</li>\n<li>对正常数据 patch 重建精准，对异常 patch 重建失败</li>\n<li>天然处理长程依赖和多尺度模式</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"子序列异常检测\">子序列异常检测</h2><p>当异常表现为一段连续序列的模式变化（而非单点偏离）时，需要子序列级别的检测：</p>\n<p><strong>Matrix Profile</strong> 算法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对每个子序列，找到其在全序列中的最近邻距离</li>\n<li>距离异常大的子序列即为模式异常</li>\n<li>时间复杂度：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（STOMP 优化后接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Discord Discovery</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>找到与所有其他子序列都不相似的子序列</li>\n<li>Matrix Profile 中距离最大的即为 top-1 discord</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>discord</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></munder><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{discord}(T_i) = \\min_{j \\neq i, |i-j| &gt; m} d(T_i, T_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">discord</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.716em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mord vbox mtight\"><span class=\"thinbox mtight\"><span class=\"rlap mtight\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak mtight\"></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"多变量异常检测\">多变量异常检测</h2><p>现实系统通常有数十到数百个监控指标同时变化。多变量异常的挑战：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单个指标正常，但指标间关系异常（如 CPU 高但吞吐量低）</li>\n<li>维度灾难：高维空间中密度估计不可靠</li>\n<li>根因定位：检测到异常后需要知道是哪些指标贡献</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>图注意力网络（GAT）方法</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>将指标建模为图的节点</li>\n<li>边权重表示指标间的正常相关性</li>\n<li>图注意力机制聚合邻居信息进行预测</li>\n<li>预测偏差 + 注意力权重变化 → 异常检测 + 根因归因</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>OmniAnomaly / USAD / TranAD</strong>：2020-2023 年的代表性多变量方法，使用 GRU/Transformer + VAE 联合建模时间依赖和变量间关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程实践-告警系统设计\">工程实践：告警系统设计</h2><p>从异常分数到可用的告警系统，需要解决以下工程问题：</p>\n<p><strong>告警疲劳（Alert Fatigue）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>问题：高灵敏度导致大量误报，运维人员开始忽略告警</li>\n<li>解决：分级告警（Info/Warning/Critical）+ 聚合抑制 + 根因关联</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>延迟 vs 精度权衡</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>流式检测需要在数据到达后立即判断</li>\n<li>等待更多上下文可以提高精度但增加延迟</li>\n<li>实践：先做快速初判（低精度），再用完整上下文确认</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>标注数据缺乏</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>真实异常事件稀少且标注昂贵</li>\n<li>解决方案：弱监督（少量标注+自监督）、主动学习（让系统问运维人员最有价值的样本）、合成异常注入</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"评估指标的特殊性\">评估指标的特殊性</h2><p>异常检测的评估不同于一般分类任务：</p>\n<p><strong>点调整（Point-Adjust）F1</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果模型检测到一段异常中的任何一个点，就认为该段被正确检测</li>\n<li>适合「检测到就行」的场景（SRE 告警）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>范围感知指标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>考虑检测到的异常与真实异常的时间重叠程度</li>\n<li>检测到但延迟太久的不应该给满分</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>业务对齐</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>真正重要的是：检测到了多少<strong>需要人工介入</strong>的真实事件</li>\n<li>每周误报数是否在运维团队可接受范围内</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>时序异常检测本质是隐式预测 + 偏差量化</li>\n<li>基于预测的方法利用概率预测自然产出异常概率</li>\n<li>子序列异常需要 Matrix Profile 或形状匹配方法</li>\n<li>多变量场景需要建模指标间关系，图方法是主流</li>\n<li>工程上告警疲劳是最大敌人，需要分级+聚合+根因归因</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>预测模型如何为异常检测提供基础 → <a href=\"../foundations/statistical-models\">经典统计模型</a></li>\n<li>管道中异常检测模块的集成 → <a href=\"../systems/pipeline-architecture\">预测管道架构</a></li>\n<li>推荐系统中类似的异常流量/欺诈检测问题 → <a href=\"../../recommendation-algorithms/systems/recall-ranking-pipeline\">召回-排序管道</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"时序异常检测","id":"时序异常检测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基于预测的异常检测","id":"基于预测的异常检测"},{"level":2,"text":"基于重建的方法","id":"基于重建的方法"},{"level":2,"text":"子序列异常检测","id":"子序列异常检测"},{"level":2,"text":"多变量异常检测","id":"多变量异常检测"},{"level":2,"text":"工程实践：告警系统设计","id":"工程实践-告警系统设计"},{"level":2,"text":"评估指标的特殊性","id":"评估指标的特殊性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"金融时序预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/applications/financial-forecasting"},"next":null}